      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Super Titles",
      "Anchor": "super-titles",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Super Titles API is a collection of standard base job title entities.\nThis API doesn\u2019t share member personal data as part of the API response.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Super Titles",
      "Anchor": "super-titles",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Super Titles are high-level job title categories that group related standardized titles (e.g., \u0022Accountant\u0022 groups various accounting-related titles).",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Super Titles",
      "Anchor": "super-titles",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Super Titles",
      "Anchor": "super-titles",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "This API may also be referred to as \u0022Job Title Category\u0022 or \u0022Base Job Title\u0022 in other contexts.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Super Titles",
      "Anchor": "super-titles",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The service provides the following methods:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Super Titles",
      "Anchor": "super-titles",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Get a Super Title entity.\nGet all super titles that are available in the taxonomy.\nBatch get super title entities for a set of super title IDs.",
